Yes, you're right, for react-native we probably need something like you proposed before: 

``` js
import {range} from 'react-instantsearch/connectors';
// the connectors are in their own namespace to enforce using predictable naming
import {RangeInput} from 'react-instantsearch';
// the default level is for connected components / widgets
import {RangeInputComponent} from 'react-instantsearch/component';
// this namespace for the dumb components if we wish to expose them
```
